# Generated OpenAPI documentation bundle — BOTH contracts on one page since DL-145.
# Regenerate from the YAML, never edit or commit it — a checked-in bundle is stale the
# moment docs/contracts/openapi*.yaml changes, and it is 350 KB of noise in every
# diff. CI uploads it as the `stats-api-v1-draft` workflow artifact:
#     docs/contracts/build-html.sh
stats-api-v1-draft.html
